<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS3" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ MixReasoning: Switching Modes to Think" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.3 </span>Additional qualitative examples</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
